{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35577","headline":"鄂渚除夜书怀 · 来鹄","name":"鄂渚除夜书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹦鹉洲头夜泊船，此时形影共凄然。\n难归故国干戈後，欲告何人雨雪天。\n筯拨冷灰书闷字，枕陪寒席带愁眠。\n自嗟落魄无成事，明日春风又一年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"来鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"罗 玲"}